  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -130,
      "params": {
        "text": "Mission founding + conversion (spec/systems/natives.md func_0572E6). The tribe reaction to a new mission follows its attitude band (alarm/tension: Content->curiosity @MISSION0, Uneasy->cautious @MISSION1, Restless->offended @MISSION2, Angry->hostility @MISSION3). Conversion roll: P(convert)=(TribeQuality+2)/15, DOUBLED for an expert (Jesuit) missionary; roll random_int(0,15) succeeds when roll < threshold; a convert (class 0x1B) is created at the colony. FLAGGED: TribeQuality is per-tribe (TribeData+2), modeled as Constant=4."
      }
